		2064 -> 2072 [label=false,color=brown];
	2065 [label="He chews upon the leg, and though it opens the wound and brings him pain, it also brings him relief.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2065 -> 2073;
	2066 [label="Hah ! It is too late for that now. Marie, au travail ! Il y a de l'amour dans l'air !",shape=box,color=blue];
		2066 -> 2074;
	2067 [label="Oui ! And you could not stop me, even if you wished. Marie, to work !",shape=box,color=blue];
		2067 -> 2075;
	2068 [label="Chat ends.",color=orange];
	2069 [label="Oui, of course. À bientôt.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2069 -> 2076;
	2070 [label="Oui, of course.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2070 -> 2060;
	2071 [label="You know how my story begins, but there is a portion I did not tell you.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2071 -> 2077;
	2072 [label="Update boolean MarieBackstory1",color=orange];
		2072 -> 2078;
	2073 [label="It harms him, but it is part of him, all the same. And if you approach him avec colère, if you are harsh, he will flinch from your touch.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2073 -> 2079;
	2074 [label="Chat ends.",color=orange];
	2075 [label="Chat ends.",color=orange];
	2076 [label="Chat ends.",color=orange];
	2077 [label="I told you that I was a beggar upon the streets, when I was a jeune fille. And that I did well for myself and that I had many friends.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2077 -> 2080;
	2078 [label="I was born into a rich famille, which might surprise you. The bourgeois class, who are closer to the Orokin than not.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2078 -> 2081;
	2079 [label="You must earn the trust of the stray. Let him come to you, non ? Does this make sense ?",shape=box,color=blue];
		2079 -> 2082;
		2079 -> 2083;
		2079 -> 2084;
	2080 [label="One of them was a big older boy named Hugo.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2080 -> 2085;
	2081 [label="But when I was born as I was... deformed, with mes pieds tordus et inutilisables ? Oh, ma mère could not have that.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2081 -> 2086;
	2082 [label="Yes, actually. Thank you.",shape=box,color=red];
		2082 -> 2087;
	2083 [label="More than it should, thank you.",shape=box,color=red];
		2083 -> 2088;
	2084 [label="None. But thanks for trying.",shape=box,color=red];
		2084 -> 2089;
	2085 [label="He was a bit of the leader of the pack. And he always made sure no one picked on me and I had all I needed.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2085 -> 2090;
	2086 [label="There were appearances to be maintained, oui ? Standards to be kept.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2086 -> 2091;
	2087 [label="Bien ! I was afraid I let my metaphors get away from me again.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2087 -> 2092;
	2088 [label="Marie and her metaphors. Ah, bon.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2088 -> 2092;
	2089 [label="Mince alors. I knew I let my métaphores get away from me again.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2089 -> 2092;
	2090 [label="He even helped me build des béquilles - you might call them... eh... crutches ? That I could use to drag myself about, with bits of wood we scavenged.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2090 -> 2093;
	2091 [label="So, what was to be done, with poor malformed Marie ? I was brought to la Cité de la Lumière, where certainly I would parish upon the streets...",shape=box,color=blue];
		2091 -> 2094;
	2092 [label="Hm. It occurs to me that perhaps describing Lyon as a stray dog is not the most flattering comparison to make...",shape=box,color=blue];
		2092 -> 2095;
	2093 [label="One morning, we went to go wake him, and we found him -",shape=box,color=blue];
		2093 -> 2096;
	2094 [label="And abandoned to die.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2094 -> 2097;
		2094 -> 2098;
	2095 [label="Perhaps do not tell him I did so, oui...?",shape=box,color=blue];
		2095 -> 2099;
	2096 [label="Je... I will spare you the details... I am certain you can guess.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2096 -> 2100;
	2097 [label="How old were you?",shape=box,color=red];
		2097 -> 2101;
	2098 [label="Your family left you for dead?",shape=box,color=red];
		2098 -> 2102;
	2099 [label="Update boolean LyonStrayDog",color=orange];
		2099 -> 2103;
		2099 -> 2104;
	2100 [label="But he left us a note. It was barely legible. He was the only one of the other children who knew his letters, and I had to read it to the others. ",shape=box,color=blue];
		2100 -> 2105;
	2101 [label="Six ? Seven ? In their eyes, they had tried their best to mend me for many years. Tutors to teach me to walk. Braces. Footwear.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2101 -> 2106;
	2102 [label="In their eyes, they had tried their best to mend me for many years. Tutors to teach me to walk. Braces. Footwear.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2102 -> 2106;
	2103 [label="I think it's adorable, and so will he.",shape=box,color=red];
		2103 -> 2107;
	2104 [label="Your secret is safe with me.",shape=box,color=red];
		2104 -> 2108;
	2105 [label="I remember still how my voice choked. But I had to stay strong. Because even then, I knew that I had a duty to the others. ",shape=box,color=blue];
		2105 -> 2109;
	2106 [label="They were tired of the burden. So, barely able to even read and write my numbers and letters, I found myself in the muck.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2106 -> 2110;
		2106 -> 2111;
	2107 [label="Quelle horrible personne ! J'espère que votre chaise va s'effondrer et vous donner plein d'échardes douloureuses !",shape=box,color=blue];
		2107 -> 2112;
	2108 [label="Merci ! What a relief...",shape=box,color=blue];
		2108 -> 2113;
	2109 [label="Hugo had always seemed so happy to us, they said to me. Si joyeux. Always meeting life with a laugh and a sneer.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2109 -> 2114;
	2110 [label="That's horrible.",shape=box,color=red];
		2110 -> 2115;
	2111 [label="How did you survive?",shape=box,color=red];
		2111 -> 2115;
	2112 [label="Chat ends.",color=orange];
	2113 [label="Chat ends.",color=orange];
	2114 [label="Even when we were chased away or he was beaten with a stick for theft or loitering, it did not seem to bother him.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2114 -> 2116;
	2115 [label="Check boolean MarieSecretPower",color=orange];
		2115 -> 2117 [label=true,color=green];
		2115 -> 2118 [label=false,color=brown];
	2116 [label="But we never know the depth of the pain others feel in their hearts. And in that letter, I knew he wept with Lua.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2116 -> 2119;
	2117 [label="It was like you said, non ? All inconveniences come with a secret power.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2117 -> 2118;
	2118 [label="What made me indésirable pour ma mère, made me quite popular amongst the other children of the streets.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2118 -> 2120;
	2119 [label="But that he was now at peace at her side. For a time, I resented him for leaving. For the others looked to me for guidance. And I resented him for abandoning me.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2119 -> 2121;
	2120 [label="What is more pathétique than a child with no pieds, oui ? I could earn more in a day with open palms than they could rob in a week.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2120 -> 2122;
	2121 [label="But over time, I came to understand the truth of it.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2121 -> 2123;
	2122 [label="And I was always wont to share. So I had many friends who would look out for me, take care of me. One of them was a big older boy named Hugo.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2122 -> 2085;
	2123 [label="We can only forgive ourselves for being human. And forgive ourselves the pain of their leaving.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2123 -> 2124;
	2124 [label="For it is their absence that hurts us. And the thought that we could not do more to aid them.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2124 -> 2125;
	2125 [label="The burdens that others carry are never ours to know.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2125 -> 2126;
	2126 [label="And that is a great tragédie. But it is what it means to be human.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2126 -> 2127;
	2127 [label="I do not know if this story aided you. But I can only pray that it did. I must go, Monsieur Loid is calling.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2127 -> 2128;
		2127 -> 2129;
	2128 [label="Thank you, Marie.",shape=box,color=red];
		2128 -> 2130;
	2129 [label="[Stay silent.]",shape=box,color=red];
		2129 -> 2131;
	2130 [label="+20 Chemistry",color=orange];
		2130 -> 2132;
	2131 [label="+20 Chemistry",color=orange];
		2131 -> 2133;
	2132 [label="You are most welcome. À bientôt.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2132 -> 2134;
